FLOW_UNITS           CMS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
LINK_OFFSETS         DEPTH
MIN_SLOPE            0
ALLOW_PONDING        NO
SKIP_STEADY_STATE    NO
START_DATE           06/01/2024
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    06/01/2024
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             06/01/2024
